Package: oiReachtas
Title: R Interface to the Houses of the Oireachtas Open Data API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathal@example.com")
Description: Provides a tidy interface to the Houses of the Oireachtas
    (Irish Parliament) Open Data API <https://api.oireachtas.ie/>.
    Enables retrieval of parliamentary members, debates, questions,
    divisions (votes), legislation, constituencies, parties, and houses.
    Designed to support downstream analysis such as sentiment analysis of
    debates, member activity tracking, and legislative research.
